| Lowest-ceremony entry into the SDLC pipeline (developer preset) | the agentic-sdlc `sdlc-direct` skill | For tasks the human has already sized; no autonomous escalation of scope. |
| Check agentic-sdlc environment readiness (devops preset) | the agentic-sdlc `sdlc-preflight` skill | Read-only probe; rewrites only its own doctor report. |
